        {
          "text": " Konye mam abu Solomon kitubulesene idwe luka Isirael kanuka akeswam; konye keraas kesi ikajiok, ka ikapolok luka ikapolokoke, ka ikapolokitok luka agalinike ka ikebwanenokoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
