          "text": " kwape kibusakinitor nuka ŋinipaaran, koinanakini kwape ajaar aicorakinet naka Musa, ka nukasabaton, ka napilamununei elap, kopucin lueseunitai, irwan auni ŋolikaru, kopucit loka emugati lomam itubuunitoi, kopucit loka asabaton, kopucit da loka iswamin. ",
