        {
          "text": " Kitemok, kwape ajaar aicorakinet naka Daudi papake, abeanakin naka isasedotin kaijaanakinikec, ka Ilebin kaswamukec, aiturit, ka aijaanakin isasedotin kwape epudar aswam naka ŋinipaaran: ikagolok da kabeanakinikec korutei kere: naarai abu Daudi etuŋanan loka Edeke kicorak kwaŋin. ",
